 triage:issue "Canonical request/start/target/environment DTOs derive Debug over payload, Python module, Monty source, and environment Set/Reference contents. C3 also adds a public CronAction whose derived Debug prints the entire --request JSON string. Normal diagnostic formatting therefore exposes the specifically prohibited data." ;
