 triage:issue "Derived Debug on canonical request/start/target/environment DTOs renders payload, Python/Monty source and environment Set/Reference data. C3 newly exposes the same raw request via public CronAction Debug (template/crates/cli/src/cron_commands.rs:8) and Command::Cron Debug (cli/src/lib.rs:37-43). Formatting these standard diagnostic representations emits content the value-free/redaction contract forbids, including reference strings." ;
