 triage:status "implemented_pending_reqa" ;
 triage:reviewed_commit "81147f025a356ea72caf17439c38b10c4d9d7627" ;
 triage:file "crates/sc-cron/src/consumer_contract.rs" ;
 triage:issue "The advertised application-owned CronOperations replacement cannot obtain StoreOperationContext in a normal worker-independent consumer: fields are private and the only direct factory is operation_context_probe under test-utils at80-86. The frozen StandardCronExecutor constructor requires that context. This leaves the promised narrower custom-schema/own-lifecycle seam without a supported production composition path." ;
 triage:action "Freeze and provide an ordinary production context/ownership construction path for custom operations, preserving shared cancellation and earliest deadlines, and prove normal-feature external composition without a dummy Scheduler worker or test-utils." ;
