 triage:file "See reviewer source and target references in the published QA report." ;
 triage:issue "Runtime deadline recovery advises replay of cron mutations whose persistence may still be unknown." ;
 triage:action "Keep the existing 503 codes and generic runtime boundary, but make timeout/drain recovery accurately state that completion/persistence can be unknown and require an authorized status/reconciliation decision before replay of a mutation. Preserve completed custom-executor errors. Add a causal short/controlled-deadline middleware regression with work admitted before the cutoff and completed afterward; verify no response recommends blind replay. No cron dependency, idempotency ledger, or new public wrapper is required." ;
